WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.456 --> 00:00:02.493
- [Narrator] Racism and xenophobia are,

00:00:02.493 --> 00:00:04.056
unfortunately, everywhere.

00:00:04.056 --> 00:00:08.566
However, one woman is
turning this into this.

00:00:08.566 --> 00:00:10.400
Meet Germany's hate destroyer.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:12.900
(light music)

00:00:20.154 --> 00:00:23.094
In Germany, former teacher
Irmela Mensah-Schramm

00:00:23.094 --> 00:00:26.860
has made it her life mission
to remove any neo-Nazi stickers

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:29.334
and graffiti around her country.

00:00:29.334 --> 00:00:30.527
It's no each feat though.

00:00:30.527 --> 00:00:31.685
- Nein.

00:00:31.685 --> 00:00:33.877
- [Narrator] And how does one arm oneself

00:00:33.877 --> 00:00:36.377
for a war against street hate?

00:00:42.583 --> 00:00:44.691
- [Narrator] Irmela's
been covering, removing

00:00:44.691 --> 00:00:47.391
and obscuring these
messages since the eighties.

00:00:47.391 --> 00:00:49.983
She keeps a record of
everything she's wiped out,

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:51.733
all over her country.

00:01:03.046 --> 00:01:04.865
- [Narrator] Everyday,
except for Sundays,

00:01:04.865 --> 00:01:09.032
Irmela packs her bags and
heads off to the streets.

00:01:11.067 --> 00:01:14.125
Sometimes she nails a
big one, like this heart.

00:01:14.125 --> 00:01:16.079
It used to be a swastika.

00:01:16.079 --> 00:01:19.076
Other times, it's small,
but even the crudest message

00:01:19.076 --> 00:01:20.409
doesn't slip by.

00:01:47.761 --> 00:01:49.817
- [Narrator] And as long as
there's hate in this world,

00:01:49.817 --> 00:01:52.650
Irmela will be there, can in hand.

